#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.fullmatch.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.fullmatch"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.fullmatch:1
msgid "Determine if each string entirely matches a regular expression."
msgstr "确定每个字符串是否完全匹配正则表达式。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.fullmatch:3
msgid ""
"Checks if each string in the Series or Index fully matches the specified "
"regular expression pattern. This function is useful when the requirement "
"is for an entire string to conform to a pattern, such as validating "
"formats like phone numbers or email addresses."
msgstr "检查 Series 或 Index 中的每个字符串是否完全匹配指定的正则表达式模式。当要求整个字符串符合某种模式时，此函数非常有用，例如验证电话号码或电子邮件地址等格式。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.fullmatch.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.fullmatch:8
msgid "Character sequence or regular expression."
msgstr "字符序列或正则表达式。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.fullmatch:10
msgid "If True, case sensitive."
msgstr "如果为 True，则区分大小写。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.fullmatch:12
msgid "Regex module flags, e.g. re.IGNORECASE."
msgstr "正则表达式模块标志，例如 re.IGNORECASE。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.fullmatch:14
msgid ""
"Fill value for missing values. The default depends on dtype of the array."
" For the ``\"str\"`` dtype, ``False`` is used. For object dtype, "
"``numpy.nan`` is used. For the nullable ``StringDtype``, ``pandas.NA`` is"
" used."
msgstr "缺失值的填充值。默认值取决于数组的数据类型。对于 ``\"str\"`` 数据类型，使用 ``False``。对于对象数据类型，使用 ``numpy.nan``。对于可空的 ``StringDtype``，使用 ``pandas.NA``。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.fullmatch.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.fullmatch:20
msgid ""
"The function returns a Series, Index, or array of boolean values, where "
"True indicates that the entire string matches the regular expression "
"pattern and False indicates that it does not."
msgstr "该函数返回一个布尔值的 Series、Index 或数组，其中 True 表示整个字符串匹配正则表达式模式，False 表示不匹配。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.fullmatch.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.fullmatch:27
msgid ":py:obj:`match`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.fullmatch:28
msgid ""
"Similar, but also returns `True` when only a *prefix* of the string "
"matches the regular expression."
msgstr "类似，但当字符串的*前缀*匹配正则表达式时也会返回 `True`。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.fullmatch:30
msgid ":py:obj:`extract`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.fullmatch:31
msgid "Extract matched groups."
msgstr "提取匹配的组。"
